<Layouts.page title={@page_title} label="privacy.txt">
  <h1>MVD Webcam Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>
    This application does not collect or store personal data. Live camera and microphone
    data is transmitted between your Apple Vision Pro and your computer over your local
    network. This data is never sent to the developer or any third party, and is not
    recorded or retained.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you installed this application from the App Store, then Apple does collect some
    personal data. Please see Apple's privacy policy here:
    <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/" target="_blank">
      https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/
    </a>
  </p>
</Layouts.page>
